#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:132
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:304
#: utilities/queuemanager/basetools/enhance/autocorrection.cpp:59
msgid "Auto Levels"
msgstr "स्वत: तह"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:133
msgid ""
"<b>Auto Levels</b>:<p>This option maximizes the tonal range in the Red, "
"Green, and Blue channels. It searches the image shadow and highlight limit "
"values and adjusts the Red, Green, and Blue channels to a full histogram "
"range.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>स्वत: तह</b>:<p>यो विकल्पले रातो, हरियो र निलो च्यानलमा टोन सम्बन्धी दायरा "
"अधिकतम गर्दछ । यसले छवि छायाँ खोजी गर्दछ र सीमित मानहरू हाइलाइट गर्दछ र रातो, "
"हरियो र निलो च्यानललाई पूरा हिस्टोग्राम दायरामा समायोजन गर्दछ ।</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:141
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:308
#: utilities/queuemanager/basetools/enhance/autocorrection.cpp:60
msgid "Normalize"
msgstr "सामान्यीकरण"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:142
msgid ""
"<b>Normalize</b>:<p>This option scales brightness values across the active "
"image so that the darkest point becomes black, and the brightest point "
"becomes as bright as possible without altering its hue. This is often a "
"\"magic fix\" for images that are dim or washed out.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>सामान्यीकरण</b>:<p>यो विकल्पले सबभन्दा गाढा बिन्दुलाई कालो बनाउन सक्रिय छवि "
"वरिपिर चम्किलोपन मान स्केल गर्दछ र चम्किलो बिन्दुलाई त्यसको ह्यु एकान्तर नगरिकन सम्भव "
"भएसम्मको चम्किलो बनाउछ । यो प्राय मधुरो वा खुइलिएको छविका लगि \"जादु समाधान\" हुन्छ "
"।</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:151
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:312
#: utilities/queuemanager/basetools/enhance/autocorrection.cpp:61
msgid "Equalize"
msgstr "तुल्यकारक"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:152
msgid ""
"<b>Equalize</b>:<p>This option adjusts the brightness of colors across the "
"active image so that the histogram for the value channel is as nearly as "
"possible flat, that is, so that each possible brightness value appears at "
"about the same number of pixels as each other value. Sometimes Equalize "
"works wonderfully at enhancing the contrasts in an image. Other times it "
"gives garbage. It is a very powerful operation, which can either work "
"miracles on an image or destroy it.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>तुल्यकारक</b>:<p>यो विकल्पले सक्रिय छविमा रङ चम्किलोपन मान च्यानलका लागि "
"हिस्टोग्राम सम्भव फ्ल्याटको नजिक हुने गरि समायोजन गर्दछ, जसले गर्दा प्रत्येक सम्भव "
"चम्किलोपन मान अन्य मानको पिक्सले नम्बरसँग बराबर देखिन्छ । कहिले काहि तुल्यकारकले छविमा "
"व्यतिरेक बढाउन राम्रोसँग काम गर्दछ । अन्य समयमा फोहर पैदा गर्दछ । यो धेरै शक्तिशाली "
"सञ्चालन हो जसले कहिले काहि धेरै राम्रो काम गर्दछ र कहिले काहि छविलाई खत्तम बनाउछ ।</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:164
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:316
#: utilities/queuemanager/basetools/enhance/autocorrection.cpp:62
msgid "Stretch Contrast"
msgstr "व्यतिरेक फैलाउनुहोस्"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:165
msgid ""
"<b>Stretch Contrast</b>:<p>This option enhances the contrast and brightness "
"of the RGB values of an image by stretching the lowest and highest values to "
"their fullest range, adjusting everything in between.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>व्यतिरेक फैलाउनुहोस्</b>:<p>यो विकल्पले छविको RGB मान तिनिहरूको न्यूनतम र उच्च "
"मानलाई पूर्ण मानमा फैलाएर चम्किलोपन र व्यतिरेक बढाउछ । सबैकुरा बिचमा समायोजन गर्दछ ।</"
"p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:173
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:320
#: utilities/queuemanager/basetools/enhance/autocorrection.cpp:63
msgid "Auto Exposure"
msgstr "स्वत: प्रर्दशन"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/autocorrectiontool.cpp:174
msgid ""
"<b>Auto Exposure</b>:<p>This option enhances the contrast and brightness of "
"the RGB values of an image to calculate optimal exposition and black level "
"using image histogram properties.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>स्वत: प्रर्दशन</b>:<p>यो विकल्पले छवि हिस्टोग्राम गुण प्रयोग गरेर अनुकूल प्रर्दशन र "
"कालो तह गणना गर्न छविको RGB मानको व्यतिरेक र चम्किलोपन बढाउछ ।</p>"

